window.products.push({"id":962126,"name":"2pcs Green Eucalyptus Leaves Garland with LED Lights Great for Year Round Decor, Parties, Weddings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GORspZNmL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"One great plus to this great eucalyptus leaves garland is that it looks great on or off. With the pre strung lights operated at a flip of a switch, it will help create the right ambience at your wedding, party or special space at home. But if you want to just keep greenery in your decor, lights can stay off. This green leaf eucalyptus garland is easy to use and position. The leaves and vines are easy to manipulate into the position or location that you like. The lights are operated by battery. (3 AA batteries not included). Whether it's draped on mantel, or set on a table, the soft lights really make an impression. There are 20 LED lights, running thru just about 5 feet of leafy green foliage that is drape-able, bendable and moveable. Great for an enchanted forest theme.  So if you are looking to create mood lighting while adding some nature to your decorating, this pre lit eucalyptus garland lit or unlit will help you do that. Turn off via the switch when not in use. It really adds that extra special ambience to any space it is placed or hung. And even when off, your leafy mini wonder keeps the nature vibe alive wherever you place it.  Qty 2 5.5 ft garlands","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GORspZNmL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B57NXD89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B57NXD89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B57NXD89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
