window.products.push({"id":962154,"name":"Rose Gold 20th Confetti Latex Balloons, Girls Happy 20 Years Birthday Party Balloon Decoration With Confetti, 12in, 16 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71phCcqyWEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12inch (30cm) helium quality latex balloons with rose gold confetti dots. Including 16pcs latex balloons filled with gold confetti. Printed on two sides, with black ink. Great for woman or man birthday party supplies. Approximate float time: helium 8-14 hours, air 5-7 days. Balloons are shipped uninflated. How to use: rub the ballon with your hands, or hair, clothing, carpet repeatedly to make static electricity, the confetti will stick to the balloon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71phCcqyWEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAGJUCHE","source_asin":"B091TS6GSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TS6GSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TS6GSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":962155,"name":"10pc LED Balloons Party Balloons Light up Clear Bobo Bubble Balloons Helium or Air(multicolor) (multicolor, 10)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xE8U+NpzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CONTENTS 10-bobo balloons of inflated size 18 inches in diameter when fully inflated (2 extra for a test run) 10-multicolored led string lights of 10 foot long each An illustrated instruction guide as seen in listing photo TIPS FOR USING HELIUM When using helium make sure to inflate the ballons larger than 16 inches in diameter to ensure they can hold the weight of the LED lights. Unlike latex balloons, bobo baloons should be inflated slowly. TIPS FOR USING AIR When using air the balloons can stay inflated of weeks. A popular party decoration choice is to attach the battery boxes to the ceiling, and let the balloons hang down upside. Perfect choice as wedding balloons, or large birthday party balloons, bachelorette party decorations that need a lot of lighting décor to fill a large space. What is the difference between these balloons and normal latex balloons? Latex balloons are more stretchy but can not achieve 100% clear transparency like bobo balloons. Can they be reused? The LED firefly string lights can be reused. Best to visit our amazon store for a refill pack of 20/50 bobo balloons. What events are they suitable for? birthday balloons, independence day decorations, pool parties, graduation baloons, great for bachelorette party decorations, wedding balloons, Halloween party balloons,4th of July decorative lighting for garden parties. How long will the helium filled balloons float for? This depends on variables such as the quality of the helium tank, how well the knot was sealed. A safe estimation is 10 hours. Use one of the extra balloon to do a test run a few days before your event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xE8U+NpzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lightsfever","source_asin":"B0917DTQ5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0917DTQ5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0917DTQ5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
