window.products.push({"id":962317,"name":"ER CHEN Remote Battery Operated 40ft 240 Led String Lights Silver Wire 8 Lighting Model LED Starry Light with 13 Key Remote Control for Christmas Wedd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fdPIT4kRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【QUALITY ASSURANCE】Each product of ER CHEN has been through rigorous testing before shipment, when you receive the product if you find any problems, we will unconditionally offer you a free replacement. They possess FCC and CE certificates and meet environmentally-friendly RoHS, safety guaranteed. We provide you with 12 months’ warranty, 60 days Money Guarantee, 7 days/24 hrs Customer Service. 【Indoor & Outdoor Decoration】240 Super bright LED lights on 40 ft long ultra thin silver coated copper wire with 2 inches distance between LED bulbs and 20 inches clear cable between first led bulb and battery box. These twinkling lights are perfect ornaments for decorating bedroom, garden, patio, front porch. Embellishing your holiday, wedding, DIY dinner party centerpiece, Valentine's Day and Christmas gathering. 【Flexible and Durable】Made from high quality 3-Strands silver coated copper wires, this fairy light is durable enough to experiment with any shapes as you like. It can be easily bended and shaped around almost anything, such as trees, plants, fences, signs, balcony and so on. 【Remote Control and Timer】You can easily turn on/off the lights with a 13-key remote in hand. 8 modes and 10 brightness levels to create ideal ambiance. To avoid forgetting to turn off the lights, the timer function to automatically have lights stay 6 hours on and 18 hours off per day. 【Completely Waterproof】The wire parts of the string lights are fully sealed, it have IP65 waterproof level, can working under the water; The battery box has IP44 waterproof level, that means it's no problem to use outdoors, but please avoid placing the battery case under water to make it more durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fdPIT4kRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ER CHEN","source_asin":"B019SXLUJE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019SXLUJE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019SXLUJE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":962318,"name":"3M PPS Sun Gun Color Matching Light Kit 16400","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Y2JZ20IL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description Features and Benefits - Choose the correct variant or alternate color chip (begin with the correct paint formula) - Verify color match using spray outs (make accurate judgements regardless of location, light condition, time of day or weather) - Verify full hiding or complete coverage (Discover lack of coverage before applying clearcoat) - Identify pre and post paint defects such as pin holes, sand scratches, etc. - Packaged in a durable carrying case for portability and protection of the instrumentThis 3M&trade PPS&trade SUN GUN&trade Kit includes Color Matching Light, Color Corrective Bulb, Nicad battery pack, Battery charger with power supply and cord, safety and instruction manual, warranty registration card all packaged in a durable protective carrying case.  You&rsquo ll never look at color matching the same way again. Regardless of where the vehicle is located or where you are in the repair process n-SKU (MODEL#): AR_734004. -Brand Name: 3M. -Shipping Weight: 6.90 lbs. -Item Condition: new. Amazon.com The 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ Color Matching Light System provides a light source that replicates natural sunlight. The PPS SUN GUN Light is used in the Automotive Reconditioning Market as an aid in the process of matching interior and exterior paint colors. Sun Gun Kit color matching light 3M Sun Gun color matching light Paint sample match View larger Use Throughout the Process The 3M PPS SUN GUN Color Matching Light is designed to help auto body shop owners and their paint technicians, regardless of location, time of day, or the quality of lighting or weather conditions to: Select the correct variant or alternate color chip to begin with the correct paint formula and reduce the chance of color mismatch Select the correct variant or alternate color chip to begin with the correct paint formula and reduce the chance of color mismatch Verify and confirm color-match using spray-outs Verify and confirm color-match using spray-outs Reduce the time needed to achieve a blendable color match Reduce the time needed to achieve a blendable color match Verify full hiding or complete paint coverage Verify full hiding or complete paint coverage Discover the lack of coverage before applying clear coat Discover the lack of coverage before applying clear coat Verify blends and metallic layout for outside appearance Verify blends and metallic layout for outside appearance Identify pre-paint defects such as pin holes and sand scratches before applying the first coat of color Identify pre-paint defects such as pin holes and sand scratches before applying the first coat of color Identify post-paint defects such as swirl marks, burn-throughs, sand scratches, and lack of coverage Identify post-paint defects such as swirl marks, burn-throughs, sand scratches, and lack of coverage Overall Impact This color matching light reduces the chance of costly re-work or comebacks related to color mismatch, lack of coverage, metallic layout, pre-paint and post-paint imperfections due to inadequate lighting. Any rework or complete re-do will impact time and materials, productivity, cycle time, C.S.I. ratings, delays on other repairs, rental car costs, and late delivery penalties. Overall benefits for the shop owner include: reduced time in the paint process, improved cycle time, increased customer satisfaction index (CSI rating) and enhanced reputation for quality. Technical Explanation The spectral output of the light nearly identically matches that of daylight, allowing a painter to check color matching without having to bring the vehicle outside the shop. The emission spectra of the 3M SUN GUN (with a CRI of 99) nearly duplicates that of sunlight over the entire range of visible wavelengths of light. The color rendering index, or CRI, is a measure of the ability of a light source to reproduce the colors of various objects being lit by the source. This color matching light is useful because of the optical phenomenon known as metamerism. Two sample colors may appear to match in one lighting condition, but fail to match in another. An example of metamerism is that a technician may believe that he has achieved a color match under shop lighting conditions, but when the samples are compared in daylight, the colors no longer match. Related Products: 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ (Color Matching Light) Battery Charger & Power Supply; Part Number 16396 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ (Color Matching Light) Battery Charger & Power Supply; Part Number 16396 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ (Color Matching Light) NiCD Battery; Part Number 16398 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ (Color Matching Light) NiCD Battery; Part Number 16398 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ (Color Matching Light) Color Correction Bulb; Part Number 16399 3M™ PPS™ SUN GUN™ (Color Matching Light) Color Correction Bulb; Part Number 16399 About 3M Corporation For more than a century, 3M™ has applied innovation and technology to improving customers’ lives and supporting their business goals. Today the company, from its headquarters in St. P","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Y2JZ20IL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3M","source_asin":"B000QH945O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QH945O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QH945O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
