window.products.push({"id":962436,"name":"Bare Home Queen Sheet Set - 1800 Ultra-Soft Microfiber Bed Sheets (Queen, Red) + Comforter Set - All Season (Queen, Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pk4c475VS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber EXTREMELY SOFT AND COZY: Bare Home 7 Piece, Premium Microfiber Sheet Set and Comforter Set for Queen is everything you need for a dreamy night’s sleep with a luxurious breathable siliconized fiber filling, it is truly all season. Enjoy feeling warm and snug on a chilly evening while still feeling just right the rest of the year. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1x Red Queen Comforter (88\" x 90\"), 1x Red Fitted Sheet (60\" x 80\" x 15\"), 1x Red Flat Sheet (90\" x 102\"), 2x Red Pillow Shams (Standard Size, 20\" x 26\") and 2x Red Pillowcases (Standard Size, 20\" x 30\"). MASTERFUL CONSTRUCTION: Bare Home comforters feature a solid box stitch to contain the fill and prevent shifting or bunching. Piped edges provide a clean and elegant look. Our Luxury 1800 premium ultra-soft microfiber fabric is woven with the finest craftsmanship. Exquisitely designed with a perfect combination of durability and softness. PREMIUM QUALITY & HYPOALLERGENIC: Breathable, hypoallergenic, and double brushed microfiber yarns provide resistance from allergens, great for those prone to allergies or asthma. You will wake up feeling rested and refreshed every morning. Our linens are wrinkle, shrink, fade, and stain resistant! 30 DAY RISK FREE 100% GUARANTEE: We believe in our products so much we guarantee that you will love them! If you are not satisfied, simply contact us to return the item for a refund. Please see our return policy for details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pk4c475VS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bare Home","source_asin":"B08H425DXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H425DXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H425DXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
