window.products.push({"id":962455,"name":"JAKANI Cuir Moroccan Pouf,Genuine Goatskin Leather, Ottoman Footstool, Leather Poof,100% Handmade Leather Poof, Foot Stool, Mustard Color, Unstuffed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m21DdGAVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Jakani leather pouf is skillfully hand stitched in the traditional way, including the striking embroidery designs with vegetable silk (sabra), 100% genuine goatskin leather. Produced by skilled craftsmen in our family artisan leather workshop in Marrakech. We are an environmentally friendly company and no harmful chemicals are used in our process. Our artisans depend on recycled natural resources and the power of the sun to dry; so each pouf is unique. These Poufs are considered to be artistic pieces, not only useful furniture, but also for a great addition, and a big touch of the Moroccan tradition for every contemporary interior. It can be used in many ways: as a footstool, a low seat around the coffee table, in your children’s room, even doubling up as a quick side table, a living room set, or anywhere in your home. The smell will go with time and use. This Leather is a natural material, dyed by hand in the workshop; any minor flaws and imperfections are characteristic of the materials and methods used, and only add to the beauty and character of the product. The leather can have small scratches from the trees or bushes where they roamed, for example. This simply proves just how natural our products are. Note: Poufs are shipped unstuffed. You can use polyester or cotton fiber filling, but you can also use old cloths or towels to make it as firm or as soft as you want. Also check out our other poufs we have in store! Don't hesitate to contact us for more information and pictures. We will be happy to answer any questions. Get a beautiful, handmade Moroccan pouf for your home or living space today by clicking ‘Add to Cart’ above now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m21DdGAVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAKANI Cuir","source_asin":"B07D3YGVDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3YGVDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3YGVDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
