window.products.push({"id":962652,"name":"Oster Electric Can Opener Flip Nonstick Belgian Waffle Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ku-MBm+0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make delicious, Belgian-style waffles at home with the Oster Flip Nonstick Belgian Waffle Maker. Featuring a fun flip operation, this Belgian waffle maker lets you easily rotate the pan, so the batter fully coats the nonstick cooking surface for evenly cooked waffles. The adjustable temperature dial allows you to adjust the heat with a simple twist, while the ready indicator lights let you know when it's time to start cooking. The cool-touch handle offers a firm grip and helps prevent burns, and the removable drip tray makes cleaning simple. This waffle maker stores vertically in a cabinet or closet, saving you space. It features a stylish chrome housing with black accents to complement any kitchen décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ku-MBm+0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oster","source_asin":"B0012S8OWA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0012S8OWA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0012S8OWA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":962653,"name":"Tache 50\" X 60\" Super Soft Wild Chocolate Falls Faux Fur Sherpa Throw Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818-ewF+3zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wrap yourself in our Wild Chocolate Falls Faux Fur Throw Blanket by DaDa Bedding and Super Soft Faux Fur Sherpa this Luxury Brown Throw Blanket by DaDa Bedding which gives a unique and cozy accent of nature to your home by supplying the luxury look and feel of real Faux fur without harming any animal. *** Colors may vary from photographs due to different graphic contrasts from your computer, smart phone, or tablet *** Please message us if you would like more in-depth photos to get a better idea of the shades! :D A great accent piece for your bedroom, office, car, or living room sofa/lounge! Exceptionally plush velvety soft blanket is available in two distinct sizes to accommodate any setting. This throw blanket will bring out a luxurious elegance and high quality warmth and softness for your cold winter needs, as well as for a casual nap. (◡‿◡✿) It is available in two generous size: 50\" x 60\", 63\" x 87\" Washing Instructions: Machine Wash Cold, Do Not Bleach, Tumble Dry Low, Do Not Iron, Dry Clean. We would recommend washing in COLD WATER and then TUMBLE DRY IN LOW HEAT for the protection of the fur so it does not get damaged. :\") Material: Polyester *Soft touch and feel *Lofty and plush *Warm during the cold months, yet lightweight enough for warmer weather *Great for chilly nights on the porch or in summer air conditioning *Ideal on the bed or for cozying up on the couch *Take with you on the road in the car or RV *Perfect for picnics or park outings, even to share with your pets and more! *A wonderful gift anytime of the year *Ideal for adorning a sofa, seat or bed for an element of texture or a layer of warmth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818-ewF+3zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tache Home Fashion","source_asin":"B00F5844BS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F5844BS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F5844BS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":962654,"name":"DII Basic Barmop Collection Multi-Purpose Cleaning, Dishtowel Set, Primary, 4 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81afS9jW40L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DII dishtowels and dishcloths are 100% cotton and machine washable. With each wash, these towels become more absorbent, helping to clean up even the biggest messes; these are a must for every kitchen. With the variety of sizes, colors, and designs offered, you are sure to find the perfect color combination for your kitchen. These multi use, utility bar mobs come in a set of 4. Made of ultra-absorbent cotton these dishtowels are perfect when wiping, drying, dusting and more! They’re handy for mopping up in the kitchen or anywhere spills occur. These dish towels air dry quickly for ready to use again in no time. Why should you always cook with a bar towel/cloth nearby? Bar towels are different than the average dish towel. They are super absorbent, perfect for grabbing hot handles and subbing as a hot pad when removing stuff out of the oven in a hurry. They are great for wiping scraps into the trash or sink. With DII’s bar towels handy they can be used on a variety of surfaces from wiping up spills on the stove, to polishing plates. Consider them your extra hand in the kitchen. These bar mop dishtowels are great host & hostesses gifts. DII’s bar mop towels are a great way to welcome new neighbors. These towels & dishcloths are essential kitchen staples & would be a great addition to a gift basket for a new homeowner or first apartment. These towels work great as wrapping paper too! Consider them a two for one gift. Wrap up a picture frame of you & mom in one of our dishtowels for mother’s day or her birthday. To view more of our products visit /dii.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81afS9jW40L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B0B2MMPQG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2MMPQG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2MMPQG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
