window.products.push({"id":962742,"name":"THJ Kid Cute Hooks for Girls and Boys, Adhesive Wall Hooks for Hanging, Strong Decorative Hangers, Colorful Plastic Multifunctional Hooks for Backpack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L1i-gRKhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of black and white boring hooks? Want to find a hook for your kids for coats, baseball hats, backpacks, umbrellas? Perhaps this colorful kid's hooks will be your Best choice! Creative ideas: Colorful decoration: No longer black and white hook, while storing and keeping it tidy, it gives children more decoration space. Increase the scope of use: not only clothes, hats, towels, but also for hanging power plugs, brushes, earphones, data cables, keys, necklaces, etc. Utility hook: The hook is equipped with a strong tape, which is not easy to fall off and has a long use time. Product information: Color: Green/Yellow/Red/Blue Material: ABS Hook Size: 3.54*1.77*0.78 inch Package Size: 4.33*1.81*1.81 inch Installation procedure: 1.Clean the walls 2.Tear off the sticker 3.Paste and press How to Remove the hooks: Method 1: Turn on the hair dryer and adjust it to the hot air file, aim at the hook to heat it. After the glue becomes soft, scrape it off with your hands or a shovel. Method 2: Prepare some vinegar, soak the hook for 15-20 minutes, and then slowly tear it off. What is included in the package? 4 hooks with double-sided tape NOTES: It’s better to WAIT 24 HOURS after the hook is PASTED , then hang your items will be more firm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L1i-gRKhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THJ","source_asin":"B08R75JGGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R75JGGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R75JGGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
