window.products.push({"id":962899,"name":"Elegear Cooling Fitted Sheets King, Arc-Chill Cooling Mattress Protector for Hot Sleepers Waterproof Cooling Mattress Cover Hypoallergenic Waterproof ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VXX3F+vyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Goodbye To Night Sweats: Elegear cooling sheets use Japanese Arc-chill cool technology fabric with the highest Q-max of more than 0.5 while others’ cooling fibers only have a cooling value of 0.2. This unique fabric is much cooler and silkier than bamboo fiber, can brilliantly absorb body heat, reduce skin temperature by 2 to 5°C instantly, make you cool and comfortable without perspiration the whole night. Tip: we recommend using this cooling mattress protector WITH AIR CONDITIONING. Excellent Breathability: Different from the ordinary non-breathable waterproof mattress cover on the market, Elegear waterproof sheet is filled with fluffy cotton, form a 3D space to ensure excellent breathability, keep you cool and fresh. And the ultrasonic quilting process can firmly fix the internal padding cotton, eliminating noise and enhance the comfort and fluffiness of the cooling bed sheet. You will enjoy a comfortable and quiet sleep with it, no sticky, no noise and no plastic feel. Newly Upgraded 100% Waterproof Protection: This waterproof mattress protector adopts newly upgraded high-strength waterproof composite TPU fabrics, which can comprehensively protect your mattress pad from dust, spills, sweat, and baby bedwetting, effectively block moisture and ideal for families with children or care for the sick. All materials are OEKO certified and super skin-friendly, safe enough for anybody, allergic people can also use it with peace of mind. 8-Hour Beauty Treanment Every Night: The fabric of the cooling mattress cover contains jade masterbatch with extremely high thermal conductivity, making the king mattress protector feel silky cool, light and skin-friendly. Jade masterbatch can effectively maintain the water content of the skin and rebuild the hydrolipidic protective film, free your skin from dryness and tightness. Sleep with our cooling bed sheet, you will enjoy a 8-hour beauty treanment every night. Non-slip & Elastic Stretch Design: Elegear deep fitted sheets king are designed for king size mattress pad up to 18\", most suitable for 14\". 360° all-round package and non-slip design, won't move no matter how you flip. Elastic stretch design makes it very easy to install, just one person can complete the installation. In addition, this king mattress cover is machine washable, please use mild water below 30°, don't rinse, don't dry cleaning, don't use a dryer, dry in the shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VXX3F+vyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegear","source_asin":"B09TW7KWT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-962899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TW7KWT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TW7KWT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
